+        /* FEX cap pre-sleep (VKD3D_FEX_PRESENT_PRESLEEP=1), queue thread only. A frame cap that sleeps inside
+         * vkQueuePresentKHR (GameNative's FPS limit in its Vulkan layer does) sleeps while vkd3d holds the VkQueue,
+         * which the game's compute and copy queues share: their submits wait up to a whole frame. Once presents are
+         * seen held at a steady period, vkd3d sleeps until just before the cap's next due time without holding the
+         * VkQueue, so the cap only sleeps the last moment. */
+        struct
